{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91bc5ade2f332395a6a03586e40532104bb85acfbae51be5adc16f051cd0df08", "ja": "（今回の公演は、大盛況のうちに終了した。\nこの勢いを落とさずに行きたいところだ……）", "zh": "（这次公演在盛况之中落下了帷幕。\n真想保持住这股势头继续前进啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ca23c393ea362059abfe2a9167d5e04eb1ac7c5a2f336436851a89da3f5152f4", "ja": "あれっ、{$P$}さん……？\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}先生……？\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8eb47f26e6ce73c90137c414f3f6179333cc46e0da12663aeb70373fa5838884", "ja": "風花、お疲れさま。\n戸締まりを確認してきたところだけど……。", "zh": "风花，辛苦了。我刚确认完门锁回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d25a9ac1967c85112f9f287d4562e71c25898f76e8496df55e09793952144e69", "ja": "風花こそ、どうしたんだ？\nまだ着替えないのか？", "zh": "风花才是，怎么了？\n还不换衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f5db61c4420742d855bb03d89ecc66b27b53128723af407c1f5d68e274a10a24", "ja": "あっ、はい。急にこんなことを言って、\n変に思われるかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "啊，好的。突然说起这种事，您可能会觉得有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8be8f78440d5d045088d7b750e69482dce48bcc4f4afd9e725f971037c0e4b59", "ja": "その……劇場に、報告？みたいな……。\n公演、無事に終わったよって。", "zh": "那个……要不要向剧场报告一下？就是……演出顺利结束了之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6580774a2fc06fb8b83e7d82cd1a7127dac3f378caba3cd4dbc19d7c216c9ac", "ja": "あっ……や、やっぱり、\nおかしいですよね、私！　すみません！", "zh": "啊……那、那个，果然还是很奇怪吧，我！对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1007_p", "source_sha256": "74a5ed4a7adfeca2d976d351f4c3d65cd460a015c9fa507f8aa778e3ba5238f0", "ja": "……いや、何となくわかるよ。\n劇場にはお世話になってるしな。", "zh": "……不，我多少能理解。\n毕竟剧场一直承蒙关照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6ab3e6bb7e64e6ffb24267f6012b9b082405b9b2202997260e895dab676c38ab", "ja": "ですよね！　でも、どうやって報告したらいいか\nわからなくて……なんとなくうろうろしちゃって。", "zh": "就是嘛！可是我不知道该怎么报告……不知不觉就在这里徘徊起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b697f6f8fe75814a135b8425186def39ba1a356a0fd5475c519582675b800134", "ja": "なるほど……まあ、大丈夫だと思うよ。\nこの劇場は、風花やみんなのことが大好きだから。", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，我觉得应该没问题。  \n因为这座剧场最喜欢风花和大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1010_p", "source_sha256": "35cf0257ce8ee60cfa3ca964f14797aae3296aaced407479be0ce45d320f493a", "ja": "きっと、今回の公演も見守っていたと思う。\n最初から最後まで。", "zh": "我想，它一定也会守望着这次公演吧。\n从开始到结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9cf13dc2c5d7e9f98dbb38802ff3512e8ceaee4e5ffd178cca52af92ae79fba1", "ja": "そうだといいんですけど……。\n私たちの公演、楽しんでくれたでしょうか？", "zh": "要是那样就好了……。\n不知道他是否享受了我们的演出呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1012_p", "source_sha256": "915a3bef427319474ca12d45e5a62f4cf50d6f370b005fce7e6edc0821cba82e", "ja": "ああ。プロデューサーとして、そこは保証するよ。\n掛け値なしに、最高のステージだったって。", "zh": "啊。作为制作人，这点我可以保证。\n那绝对是最棒的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e4f601a8c76ac4fdd1af3ca0b0b604d1d266cf24e87e417e37b346a2d4c20a5e", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\nなら大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您。\n那应该就没问题了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0e85884be29d84b775c68aab4f93c5acaefe0b37d239d0b8f2e0b207c73c844", "ja": "あ……そうだ、{$P$}さん。\n今回の打ち上げ、劇場でやるのはどうですか？", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}先生。\n这次的庆功宴在剧场举办怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d969c958c82864242575027b2fc1dcd3f8f0f77996ca24d96d05c4842e778f0a", "ja": "劇場で？", "zh": "在剧场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7d119b0e79222cbaf1eeedc78b3d4d395a6b07930e2ec9904ddc1528b13718a", "ja": "はい。予算を決めて、好きな食べ物を持ち寄って。\nそうしたら、みんなで一緒にお祝いできるかなって。", "zh": "嗯。先定好预算，再各自带上喜欢的食物。\n这样的话，大家就能一起庆祝了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7499da9f16325b07d28f4858e341a94a339fc8a3da59a0a6df1b2ec227edc19", "ja": "……みんなって、変な言い方ですね。\nでもなんとなく、その方がいい気がしたんです。", "zh": "……说“大家”，听起来有点怪怪的呢。\n不过总觉得，那样做好像会更好一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e129363ca8ba1f95bb618e130fd2dcfeb7b76250fb1e6d76455ca8211657f278", "ja": "そうだな、そうしようか。\n予算的にも助かるし。", "zh": "嗯，就这么办吧。\n预算方面也能省点事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0ee5ae0cfbfcfcc795a286da85f02483516bbe4412031e39768155032044a5f0", "ja": "ふふ、なんだか締まらないですけど……\nそれじゃ私、みんなに伝えてきますね。", "zh": "呵呵，总觉得有点不够正式……\n那我去告诉大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0603_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1e0f6f548dddada677c31d6d7f71288864bac890f56e7eab6bdf8404a87c365b", "ja": "ああ、よろしく頼んだ！", "zh": "啊，那就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
